{"id":"01_5576","type":"item","name":{"ja":"30MS SIS-Y00 シュレミ[カラーB]","en":"30MS SIS-Y00 Shremi [Color B]"},"description":[{"ja":"「30 MINUTES SISTERS」シリーズに新たなシスター「30MS SIS-Y00 シュレミ[カラーB]」が登場！","en":"A new sister \"30MS SIS-Y00 Shremi [Color B]\" is now available in the \" 30 MINUTES SISTERS\" series!"},{"ja":"• キャラクター素体、タンポ印刷を施した[カラーB]の3種類の表情パーツ、武装パーツがセット。","en":"• Set includes character body, 3 types of expression parts [Color B] with tampo printing, and armed parts."},{"ja":"• ヘアスタイルパーツは、パーツ分割により2色の髪色を表現。パーツの差し替えにより角パーツの有り無しを表現できる。","en":"• Hair style parts express two different hair colors by dividing the parts. By replacing parts, you can express the presence or absence of corner parts."},{"ja":"• 衣装の一部を穴開きデザインで再現。","en":"• Part of the costume is reproduced with a hole design."},{"ja":"• 頭部の炎エフェクトはクリアパーツで再現。","en":"• The flame effect on the head is reproduced with clear parts."},{"ja":"• 「30 MINUTES SISTERS」はフェイスパーツ/ヘアスタイルパーツ/ボディパーツを部位ごとにラインアップ展開。別売りのパーツと組み替えて自分好みのシスターを創ることができる。","en":"• \"30 MINUTES SISTERS\" offers a lineup of face parts, hairstyle parts, and body parts by body part. You can create your own sister by combining parts sold separately."},{"ja":"• 30 MINUTES LABEL共通の3mmジョイントを採用。「30 MINUTES MISSIONS」のパーツもオプションとして装着が可能。(※「30 MINUTES MISSIONS」キットの対象年齢は8才以上です)","en":"• Adopts 3mm joint common to 30 MINUTES LABEL. \"30 MINUTES MISSIONS \" parts can also be installed as options. (*\" 30 MINUTES MISSIONS\" Kit is for ages 8 and up)"}],"accessories":[{"ja":"フェイスパーツ(タンポ印刷)×3","en":"Face parts (tampo printing) x 3"},{"ja":"クリアエフェクトパーツ×1式","en":"Clear effect parts x 1 set"},{"ja":"前髪パーツ(角無し)×1","en":"Bangs parts (no horns) x 1"},{"ja":"ハンドパーツ×1式","en":"Hand parts x 1 set"},{"ja":"武装パーツ×1式","en":"Armed parts x 1 set"}],"contents":[],"images":["https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/06/5L6HUrhtOGpD1LLb/qE5Qhn1cYTrvZngP.jpg?Expires=1765044071&Key-Pair-Id=K7AVJM1114TH7&Signature=YF8tlPXsf5IQAEcf9rj02HzIzjBRpxJTq5tTX3pI4aa0oRTB6E25dwRuNIHy~mlC